<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Admin Dashboard | Luxe Tech</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7fb;
            color: #0d1b2a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .wrapper {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
            max-width: 28rem;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .card h1 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
        .card p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #475569;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            color: #0d1b2a;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="card">
            <h1>Admin Dashboard</h1>
            <p>Welcome to the Luxe Tech admin portal. Your login is successful.</p>
            <div class="badge">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">verified_user</span>
                Admin Access Granted
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>